# FedMPS .gitignore
#
# What goes to GitHub: the code (fedmps/, training/, application/,
# report_figures/), the documentation, the measured results, the report
# figures, the trained adapter and the demo inputs.
# What stays local: anything large, regenerable, licence-restricted or
# private (faces of real people captured by the demo).

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- virtual environments ---------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- old runs, backups and leftovers (6.5 GB; see archive/MOVED_FILES.md) ---
archive/

# --- datasets and embeddings ------------------------------------------------
# VGGFace2 embeddings: 338 MB per file (GitHub rejects files over 100 MB), and
# derived from a licence-restricted dataset. Regenerate on AWS with
# training/01_prepare_data.py (see HOW_TO_RUN.md, section 2).
artifacts_vgg_big/
artifacts_*/
# LFW download cache
cache/

# artifacts/: keep only selector.json, which the application needs to issue
# templates. The rest is a synthetic smoke-test set and the demo database,
# which holds cases and audit entries.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/selector.json

# --- demo outputs (regenerated on every scan) -------------------------------
media/alerts/
media/*_annotated.mp4
results/video_node*.json
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

# Your own camera footage of a real person (the "vamsi" case, 13 Oct).
# Delete this line only if that person has agreed to it being public.
media/node2.mp4

# Unreferenced image left over from testing.
media/download.jpg

# Node-0 demo inputs: a third-party YouTube video ("Experience Excellence: Life at
# VIT-AP", https://youtu.be/EzHwEE6gV3E, 52 MB) and a photo of a real person from
# it. Not ours to redistribute; download the video from the link to rerun the demo.
media/node0.mp4
media/person.jpg
media/chacellor.*

# --- training-run figures (the review document's copies are in figures/) ----
figures/training_run/

# --- thesis build: intermediates and figures no longer in the thesis --------
# All regenerable with docs/thesis/make_thesis_figures.py and capture_screens.py.
docs/thesis/figures/audit_rows.json
docs/thesis/figures/fl_round.png
docs/thesis/figures/server_console.png
docs/thesis/figures/confirmed_sighting.png
docs/thesis/figures/v2_audit_rows.json
# Internal build trackers (team details, AWS account and bucket names).
docs/thesis/PROGRESS.md
docs/thesis/PROGRESS_v2.md

# --- presentation: private reports kept local ---------------------------------
# Plagiarism / originality reports.
docs/presentation/Plag-*.pdf
# Word and LibreOffice lock files and temporary exports
.~lock.*#
*.tmp

# --- logs outside training/aws_logs/ -----------------------------------------
/*.log

# --- secrets ------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# --- editors, OS and local tooling ------------------------------------------
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*

# --- personal viva preparation notes (kept local) ---------------------------
review3/
thesis_guides/
